<title>CHINA: Trading in Leading Spirit suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Leading Spirit suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Leading Spirit (Holdings) Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the consumer electronic and electrical products maker gained HK$0.175 to HK$2.425 on Tuesday on volume of 97.43 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
